#: ./items/advtech/sq_frost_tier.json
msgid ""
"You crush the beacon! The sickening scent of frozen decay fills the air, and"
" the Permafrost Dragon descends in a blinding blizzard!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'permafrost beacon', 'str_pl': 'permafrost
#. beacons'}
#: ./items/advtech/sq_frost_tier.json
msgid ""
"A grotesque, blasphemous lure crafted from tainted flesh, pheromones, and "
"pulsating frozen shards. Crushing it unleashes a concentrated, sickening "
